  <item>
    <title>EP04 找工作倒计时，快来收下这颗“求职速效救心丸”！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e08e364525864db9cec23f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e08e364525864db9cec23f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 14:01:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>开年春招如火如荼，而调研显示居然还有67%的应届生居然。。。0 offer！预感又是一年“史上最难毕业季”</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位主播带着求职速效救心丸来了！夏米曾经在</span><strong><span>大三就斩获好几份保底offer</span></strong><span>，米糕校招时更是</span><strong><span>突袭横扫10+offer</span></strong><span>，甚至浪到逐渐enjoy各种顶级公司的核心岗位的面试过程，而现在两位主播也已是拥有多年招聘经验的大厂面试官了（岁月啊。。。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期给大家讲讲艰难环境下突围的骚操作！从另辟蹊径获得不在市面上流通的机会，到如何准备一份令人心动的简历，最后是面试环节如何成竹在胸。求职的每一步都是sell自己的过程，只要有趣有料，be crazy&amp;stupid！</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，除了走人挤人的独木桥，不妨打开视野，也许还有很多小众新兴领域的职业机会等你探索。</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿大家在求职中都能得偿所愿！</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 残酷的现实：67%的23届应届生0offer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 走稳路子的“早熟”夏米大二开卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> 残酷的现实：67%的23届应届生0 offer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 走野路子的“晚熟”米糕大学也尽瞎折腾了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 米糕——突袭上岸专家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 揭秘米糕当年拿下10+offer的秘诀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 米糕：找机会要打开视野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 夏米：趁早积累社交燃料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 好的简历，大有学问！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">23:27</a> 面试是个艺术活，环节真得找专业前辈帮忙辅导和打磨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 远被低估的能力——会销售自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> 米糕sell自己的技巧和踩坑经历独家分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 当你有趣有料，你就被记住了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> “不要脸”也没关系，nothing to lose</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> “我友系列”之 校史上第一个进顶级投行的本科生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 美国时装品牌DVF CEO年轻时在纽约扫楼争取机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> 不妨打开视野，了解下小众新兴职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 语言专业学员成为一名森林疗养师！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> 顶级院校学员手握谷歌、苹果offer最终选择投身于宠物殡葬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3099">51:39</a> 毕业备选方案：延毕&amp;申请海外硕士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3493">58:13</a> 趁早盘点自己的现实情况和世俗资源，为求职早作打算</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>主播</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>夏米：</span><strong><span>提早的开窍，迟来的叛逆</span></strong><span>。10+年金融、互联网、教育行业经历，从审计民工成长为事业部负责人。知心姐姐一枚，过去擅长上班，现在学习不上班</span></p><span></span><p><span>米糕：</span><strong><span>提早的叛逆，迟来的开窍</span></strong><span>。创过业打过工，毕业第二年跃升管理层；“你的问题”解决专家；职业“指路人”。擅长于“有用之用”，沉溺于“无用之用”</span></p><span></span><h2><span>更多交流</span></h2><span></span><p><span>职业规划&amp;求职咨询：如果你正面临校招、社招/跳槽/转行，想创业，或者正在创业，想跟我们聊一聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>米糕VX：FIRE_InnerPeace</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏米VX：xia523</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>幕后制作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>SHOWNOTES：夏米、荔枝</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：荔枝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Taylor Swift-Fearless</span></p><span></span><p><span>Taylor Swift-Welcome to Newyork</span></p>]]></description>
